WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.305 --> 00:00:02.079
(upbeat music)

00:00:02.079 --> 00:00:03.541
- [Narrator] Just over 30 miles away

00:00:03.541 --> 00:00:05.768
from the Slovenian capital,

00:00:05.768 --> 00:00:07.819
this alpine lake looks like it belongs

00:00:07.819 --> 00:00:10.152
on the cover of a storybook.

00:00:17.216 --> 00:00:19.390
With a fairytale cliff-side castle,

00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:21.502
an emerald green freshwater lake,

00:00:21.502 --> 00:00:25.051
and views of some of the highest
peaks of the Julian Alps,

00:00:25.051 --> 00:00:26.981
Lake Bled and its island church

00:00:26.981 --> 00:00:29.481
make a postcard-perfect scene.

00:00:30.773 --> 00:00:32.719
To visit the Assumption of Mary Church,

00:00:32.719 --> 00:00:36.502
you must catch a ride on a
wooden boat known as a plenta.

00:00:36.502 --> 00:00:38.263
Plentas have been taking
visitors to the island

00:00:38.263 --> 00:00:41.596
in the middle of the lake for centuries.

00:00:43.231 --> 00:00:46.409
Once reaching the island,
it's a 99-stone-step climb

00:00:46.409 --> 00:00:49.184
to reach the entrance to the church.

00:00:49.184 --> 00:00:51.260
It is said that if a groom
could carry his bride

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:54.940
up these steps and ring the
wishing bell at the top,

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:57.773
the marriage would be a happy one.

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:01.416
The church is most famous for this bell,

00:01:01.416 --> 00:01:04.138
which was made in the early 16th century

00:01:04.138 --> 00:01:08.056
and is said to be a gift from the Pope.

00:01:08.056 --> 00:01:10.915
Legend has it this was
the church's second bell.

00:01:10.915 --> 00:01:13.946
The first was bought for the
church by an inconsolable widow

00:01:13.946 --> 00:01:15.522
in honor of her late husband

00:01:15.522 --> 00:01:19.061
who was murdered and then
thrown into the lake.

00:01:19.061 --> 00:01:20.972
When boatmen brought it
across to the church,

00:01:20.972 --> 00:01:22.684
an unexpected storm hit,

00:01:22.684 --> 00:01:25.351
and the bell sunk to the bottom.

00:01:28.187 --> 00:01:30.987
It is said if you listen
closely in the dead of night,

00:01:30.987 --> 00:01:32.170
you can hear the sunken bell

00:01:32.170 --> 00:01:35.179
ringing from the depths
of this picturesque lake.

00:01:35.179 --> 00:01:37.762
(upbeat music)

